Stylized Porcupinefish — 3D Model

A cute stylized 3D porcupinefish model featuring a rounded body and an expressive cartoon design. The character has a light cream body with warm orange and yellow gradients, dark spots, and contrasting spikes. Two large glossy eyes, a small smiling mouth, and bright striped fins give the fish a friendly and memorable appearance.

This model is suitable for cartoons, games, underwater scenes, educational projects, mobile applications, and children’s animation.

Main features:

stylized cartoon design;
rounded proportions;
two large eyes;
two side fins;
tail, dorsal, and lower fins;
numerous spikes covering the body;
detailed spotted coloration;
HD-quality textures;
fully designed appearance from all sides.
